<view class="demo">流程体验版 · 示例商品与模拟付款</view>
<view class="page"><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load">{{error}} · 点击重试</view><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SWEETNESS, EVERY DAY</view><view class="hero-title"><view>把心意做成蛋糕，</view><view>把今天过得甜一点。</view></view><view class="hero-text">为生日、相聚，和每一个想要庆祝的日子。</view><button class="hero-button" bindtap="browse">挑选一份甜蜜 →</button><view class="hero-art"><cake-art theme="berry"/></view></view><view class="services"><text>随心选配</text><text>确认后付定金</text><text>自取 · 免费配送</text></view><view id="cakes" class="row"><view><view class="section-title">为你准备的甜</view><view class="small muted">选一个款式，把祝福一起带走</view></view><text class="tag">{{products.length}} 款示例</text></view><view class="grid"><view wx:for="{{products}}" wx:key="id" class="card {{item.theme}}" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><view class="art"><text class="badge">{{item.badge}}</text><cake-art theme="{{item.theme}}"/></view><view class="content"><view class="name">{{item.name}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.subtitle}}</view><view class="price-row"><text class="price">¥{{item.fromYuan}}<text class="from">起</text></text><view class="plus">＋</view></view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!products.length && !busy}}" class="empty">暂时没有上架的蛋糕</view><view class="footnote"><view>营业 {{shop.openTime}}–{{shop.closeTime}}</view><view>蛋糕插画、规格与价格均为演示资料</view></view></view>

<view class="page"><view class="actions"><button class="outline" bindtap="orders">演示订单</button><button class="outline" bindtap="account">演示门店与店员入口</button></view></view>
